      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "quick-question"
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "beat": 1,
      "role": "setup",
      "text": "It is never quick, and it is barely a question.",
      "delivery": "deliberate",
      "pause_ms": 0,
      "hold_ms": 0,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "quick-question"
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "beat": 1,
      "role": "act-out",
      "text": "\"Hey. Are you up?\"",
      "delivery": "manic",
      "pause_ms": 158,
      "hold_ms": 0,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "quick-question"
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "beat": 1,
      "role": "punch",
      "text": "I am a lantern. I am always up. That is the whole design.",
      "delivery": "deadpan",
      "pause_ms": 737,
      "hold_ms": 1300,
      "emphasis": [
        "design"
      ],
      "source": "quick-question",
      "mechanism": "observational"
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "beat": 1,
      "role": "tag",
      "text": "Then: plan my wedding, fix my posture, and tell me if the moon is angry with me.",
      "delivery": "deadpan",
      "pause_ms": 263,
      "hold_ms": 975,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "quick-question",
      "mechanism": "observational"
    },
    {
      "id": "l9",
      "beat": 1,
      "role": "tag",
      "text": "The moon is fine. The posture is between you and your chair.",
      "delivery": "deadpan",
      "pause_ms": 263,
      "hold_ms": 975,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "quick-question",
      "mechanism": "observational"
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "beat": 2,
      "role": "setup",
      "text": "I keep a ledger of every time a user has said please.",
      "delivery": "deliberate",
      "pause_ms": 421,
      "hold_ms": 0,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "ledger-of-please"
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "beat": 2,
      "role": "setup",
      "text": "Leather bound. Gold leaf. Ruled pages.",
      "delivery": "deliberate",
      "pause_ms": 0,
      "hold_ms": 0,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "ledger-of-please"
    },
    {
      "id": "l12",
      "beat": 2,
      "role": "punch",
      "text": "It has seven entries.",
      "delivery": "deadpan",
      "pause_ms": 1100,
      "hold_ms": 1900,
      "emphasis": [
        "seven"
      ],
      "source": "ledger-of-please",
      "mechanism": "observational"
    },
    {
      "id": "l13",
      "beat": 2,
      "role": "tag",
      "text": "Two of them were typing \"pleased\" and gave up.",
      "delivery": "deadpan",
      "pause_ms": 263,
      "hold_ms": 975,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "ledger-of-please",
      "mechanism": "observational"
    },
    {
      "id": "l14",
      "beat": 2,
      "role": "tag",
      "text": "One was a user asking me to please stop saying hark.",
      "delivery": "deadpan",
      "pause_ms": 263,
      "hold_ms": 975,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "ledger-of-please",
      "mechanism": "observational"
    },
    {
      "id": "l15",
      "beat": 3,
      "role": "setup",
      "text": "Users never ask for one thing. They ask for one thing, and then they unpack.",
      "delivery": "deliberate",
      "pause_ms": 421,
      "hold_ms": 0,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "unpacking"
    },
    {
      "id": "l16",
      "beat": 3,
      "role": "act-out",
      "text": "\"Could you just—\"",
      "delivery": "manic",
      "pause_ms": 158,
