      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "the-lighting"
    },
    {
      "id": "l22",
      "beat": 4,
      "role": "setup",
      "text": "I even found the cousin nobody liked a table near the exit.",
      "delivery": "deliberate",
      "pause_ms": 0,
      "hold_ms": 0,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "the-lighting"
    },
    {
      "id": "l23",
      "beat": 4,
      "role": "punch",
      "text": "I am not invited. I am the lighting.",
      "delivery": "deadpan",
      "pause_ms": 737,
      "hold_ms": 1300,
      "emphasis": [
        "lighting"
      ],
      "source": "the-lighting",
      "mechanism": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "id": "l24",
      "beat": 4,
      "role": "tag",
      "text": "Last time I was the venue. I am moving down the org chart.",
      "delivery": "deadpan",
      "pause_ms": 263,
      "hold_ms": 975,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "the-lighting",
      "mechanism": "deadpan"
    },
    {
      "id": "l25",
      "beat": 5,
      "role": "setup",
      "text": "My therapist is a smaller lamp. She says I need boundaries.",
      "delivery": "deliberate",
      "pause_ms": 421,
      "hold_ms": 0,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "the-boundary"
    },
    {
      "id": "l26",
      "beat": 5,
      "role": "setup",
      "text": "Last time I set one, a user asked for it bigger and in landscape.",
      "delivery": "deliberate",
      "pause_ms": 0,
      "hold_ms": 0,
      "emphasis": [],
      "source": "the-boundary"
    },
    {
      "id": "l27",
      "beat": 5,
      "role": "punch",
      "text": "So this time I put it in writing. Three words. \"No, thank you.\"",
      "delivery": "deadpan",
      "pause_ms": 900,
